to apply diff or insert content do not use more than one line as search parameter to avoid error tool or search mismatch but make sure the content on that specific line you want to use as search is exactly the same as the one you using. make sure tool tags are accurate and closed properly. always mention the second to the line on which you want apply the diff content to placed on firstly this tells you that the line  before ( second to the line to be edited on which content should be placed) should be the search parameter